WEBVTT

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.120
Triangle's performance yesterday sure was amazing!

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:15.620
When all three are together...

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.620
They're something else!

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:24.960
Triangle's the talk of the town amongst all girls in PriPara-ucha.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.970
Doesn't it grind your gears?

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:32.260
The little jerks début their way straight into Super Cyalume Coords – and before us!

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.470
It's Usacha!

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:40.330
Hey, Usacha! Triangle really knocked 'em dead yesterday, huh? That's my little sister for you!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.480
Let your big bro give you a pat on the–

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.160
Keep your paws away from me-ucha.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.690
I'm way beyond you already, brother-ucha.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:52.020
Your unit doesn't have a single Super Cyalume Coord.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.980
You're a failure of a manager-ucha!

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:55.440
Harbinger of misfortune-ucha!

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:56.890
Harbinger of death-ucha!

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:00.980
If you touch me, I might catch your incompetence-cha!

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.080
Usagi...

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:04.510
What's going on?

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.170
Come on, Usagi-san, come back to us.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.440
Hey! You may be in charge of Tricycle or Anglerfish or whatever...

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:13.810
It's "Triangle"!

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:18.970
Well, anyway, I oughta let you know the ones who're gonna sweep the Grand Prix

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.930
aren't Triangle <i>or</i> SoLaMi SMILE!

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:25.260
It's gonna be us, Dressing Pafé!

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.620
Fufufu!

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:33.170
Don't you remember? If you want to enter the Grand Prix, you need Super Cyalume Coords!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:35.650
You can't compete without them, let alone beat us!

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.200
Smell ya later-ucha!

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:45.400
Little rat!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.220
Capisce!

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:50.420
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:51.970
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:55.220
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:58.750
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.170
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:02.730
I can't believe this!

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:40.490
I've had it up to here with this!

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:42.910
Next time, those Coords are gonna be ours!

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.910
Yes, in top form! I share your drive towards success.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:46.640
Usa... usa...

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.890
For Usagi-san as well...

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.370
I'll give it my all, too!!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.580
You're all fired up; you'll do great!

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.020
Of course!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.610
Meganii's sent us a new song!

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.880
All right, it's finally here!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.980
The song Usagi asked Meganii to make for us!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.640
It's a new song! A new song!
I don't believe it: a new song-usa!

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:17.000
Dressing Pafé has a new song?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.340
I can't wait to hear it!

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.070
It feels like it's been forever!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.390
It's smooth sailing from here!

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:26.350
We'll create the go-reatest Making Drama, too.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.740
Our show will be perfect!

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.620
The Super Cyalume Coords will fall into our hands!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:31.580
Okay, but...

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:36.760
You know it's not that easy to create a perfect Making Drama.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.980
All three of you need to cooperate to make it work.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:45.140
It'd be great if we could spend a lot more time together.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.190
Eureka!

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:53.560
You want to hold a training camp?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:58.670
Indeed. I hope to attain permission to hold a training camp

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.510
to produce a new Making Drama.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:07.200
The purpose of such a facility is to hold school <i>club</i> activities.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:08.990
But, well...

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.920
Why not?

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:16.890
I may be an educator, but I'm also a girl enamoured with PriPara!

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:21.000
I can't help but support those aiming for greater heights as idols.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.750
Make the most of this opportunity!

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.360
Thank you very much!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.410
Let's <i>go</i>!

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:36.720
Where's Dorothy?

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:38.880
She said to go on ahead...

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.480
Hey, guys!

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:44.990
Sorry I'm late. I swung by Lala's house and got delayed a bit.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:59.860
The baby Jululu and the goddess Jewlie are one in the same, remember?

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:04.590
So the surest way to get those Coords is to suck up to the one who gives them out, right?

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:07.720
Mirthless laughter – I'm appalled, Dorothy.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:10.200
We don't need to depend on a baby;

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:13.060
I intend to earn those Super Cyalume Coords fair and square.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:14.890
Calm your farms.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.510
Besides, Lala was telling me...

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.530
Her mum's in bed with a cold, so she has to help out around the store.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:24.230
She was relieved to have me take Jululu off her hands.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.540
Even so, to bring along a baby–

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:30.400
Well, hey, she's here already, so we should just...

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:34.530
Oh, that's right. Lala gave me a note on what to do to take care of her.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.660
No need to get all mad.

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.940
Yay! We're here!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:54.260
Hey, so that's where we're staying? It looks great!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.420
Tension max!

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:56.770
Where are you going?

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:57.370
What?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:01.470
This is where we're staying.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:02.910
<i>What</i>?

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.560
That last place looked loads better, though.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:10.450
Quit complaining. It was last-minute, so we only had the Mountaineering Club's room free.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.830
Cheer up, Dorothy. We can have lots of fun here, too.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.880
Jululu looks pretty excited, too.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:27.250
Hey there, Jululu. I'm Aunt Dorothy!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.600
I'm gonna take great care of you!

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:33.070
According to the note Lala left,

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.760
it's almost time to change her nappy.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.310
PSSS...

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:39.120
G–Go for it, Shion!

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:42.270
I... have to go organise our luggage.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:47.260
There we go, all clean and dry!

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:54.590
Do you want to hold her, Shion?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:58.700
Um, no, I'm fine. I wouldn't want to drop her.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.410
You'll be fine.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.460
Just hold her nice and firmly.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:04.980
I said I was fine.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:05.460
Here.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.430
I... I'm holding her.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.040
Jululu looks happy, too.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:22.340
Well, then. The foundation of a dynamic Making Drama is endurance.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:23.730
Let's get running!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.120
One, two, three, go!

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:32.880
Five, six, seven, <i>go</i>!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.700
One... two...

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.970
Three... go...

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.800
Five... six...

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:46.000
Seven... <i>go</i>...

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:51.310
Jululu's weight is the perfect handicap.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.120
Shion, don't hog her.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.180
I want to borrow Jululu too.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:06.680
Hea...vy...

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:09.940
Hey there, Jululu.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.450
Up high, up high!

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.330
Up, up high we <i>go</i>!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.330
Shion, you're like a daddy.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.030
What?

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.710
Hm... taking care of a baby is actually pretty fun.

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:30.140
And then there's...

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:31.280
<i>this</i> one.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.380
I'm just taking a quick breather!

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:43.100
A Making Drama is born from the vicissitudes of life.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:47.860
Hey, Jululu! How'd you like some snacks?

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:53.090
I got these baby cakes from a famous patisserie, you know.

00:09:58.210 --> 00:09:59.710
Aren't they yummy?

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:03.450
There's only a little bit, but they're pretty expensive.

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:06.370
Hey, but who cares about money? I sure don't.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.170
I can't put a price on Jululu's happiness.

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:12.880
And wash it down with this peach juice from an <i>exclusive</i> fruit parlour.

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:17.930
I ordered this online specially for you, Jululu.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:23.070
What d'ya reckon? Isn't hanging out with Dressing Pafé the best?

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:26.810
I bet you feel like slinging some Super Cyalume Coords our way, huh?

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:34.440
For dinner we have kenchin udon, packed with nutritious vegetables.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:38.730
It won't be tough for Jululu to eat, either.

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:41.240
I'll make some potato salad.

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:47.080
Hey there, little Jululu.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:51.080
Do you wanna play some games with Aunt Dorothy?

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:56.210
So you press circle for continuous fire, and cross to blast 'em.

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:58.300
Let's get those zombies!

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:00.090
Hey, Dorothy!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.720
You can't let a baby play violent games like that!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:06.020
I was trying to have fun with the kid, jeez.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:10.690
You should play "Where's the baby?" with her, Dorothy. She likes that one.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:16.320
Good thinking, Reona. We'll play "Where's the baby?", Dorothy-style!

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.430
Where's the baby?

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:23.280
<i>There she is</i>!

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:27.610
<i>Hey</i>... <i>wait, don't cry</i>!

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:28.580
Dorothy!

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.610
<i>It's not my fault</i>!

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:39.170
Huh? What's this supposed to be? What happened to the kenchin udon?

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:41.100
It's truly lamentable.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:45.690
While practicing swings and achieving nirvana, it appears our dinner overcooked.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.380
... This is it.

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:49.740
This... used to be udon?

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.400
But it's really soft and squishy now,

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:56.080
so Jululu can eat it without any teeth just fine.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.320
Jululu's snoozing away happily.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.610
Now, let's begin the meeting.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:16.090
Do we have any ideas for a new Making Drama after today's events?

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:23.800
Why don't we start by just using what we did today?

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:27.010
Sounds good to me! So it'd be like...

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:30.350
Making Drama, switch on!

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:33.620
Stir it!

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.440
Stew it!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.720
Thick and sloppy...

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.680
Amazing...

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:46.030
Kenchin udon!

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:47.900
Absolutely not.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:51.140
I think we're done for the day.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.850
Let's give it some more thought tomorrow.

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:15.610
See, Jululu, there's a hidden door in the wall here.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.560
All done!

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:27.180
Let's see...

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:29.950
There's no ketchup.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:34.650
Dorothy, I'm going to visit the caretaker.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:35.660
Roger that.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:43.310
Watch this. You jump here, dodge quick, and then – yeah!

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:45.050
Did you see that, Jululu?

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.010
Here we go... yeah! What a haul!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.630
Now we're in bonus time, baby!

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:54.200
Whoa, here they come! So many! And... there! 10,000 points! Woo yeah!

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.690
Go, go, go, go, go!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.410
I'm back!

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.070
Welcome back, Shion.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.810
Where's Jululu?

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:10.160
Oh, Dorothy's watching her.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:11.850
Hey, Dorothy.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:12.910
What's up?

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.270
Where's Jululu?

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:18.130
What's that? Jululu? She's right here.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:19.380
And where's "here"?

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.460
Huh? She's been here the whole...

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:24.840
Wait, what? Where'd she...

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:27.260
I guess she's disappeared.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:30.660
You idiot!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:31.620
I'm sorry!

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:41.610
Jululu!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:43.560
Did you find her?

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:44.410
No!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:45.790
Not over here either.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:48.060
She must be at the beach, then.

00:14:48.060 --> 00:14:51.160
If she goes to the sea, she could be in danger!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.250
Oh no!

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:56.860
Let's hurry!

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:57.490
Yeah!

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:20.280
Jululu!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.200
Did you see her?

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:26.300
No, I couldn't find her anywhere!

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:27.250
Hold on.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.210
What is it?

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.320
Shh.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.020
Isn't that Jululu's voice?

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.160
Jululu!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:53.760
I'm so glad!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:57.160
<i>What would I have done if we hadn't found her?</i>

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.220
So you were playing with your crab friend.

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:03.190
Jululu! Don't go running off like that!

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:11.300
But it's good you didn't go somewhere dangerous.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:13.200
You're a smart kid, Jululu.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.560
Now let's get back.

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:30.090
Do you want to play by the sea, Jululu?

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.470
All right, let's get right in there!

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:33.690
Hup!

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:36.490
Woo!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.240
That looks fun!

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:41.170
I'm gonna join in, too!

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:42.670
Full speed ahea–

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.780
Oh, you think that's funny?

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:51.080
Eat this!

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:52.440
Hey, quit it!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.490
You can't get away!

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:59.230
Here it comes!

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:02.220
And again!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.210
<i>Hey, this is feeling pretty good!</i>

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:12.670
<i>This might be what we were looking for.</i>

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.760
<i>Like reading each other's minds –
we've hit upon the same idea!</i>

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.900
How about we <i>go</i> with this?

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:20.420
One, two, and...

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:24.640
That's it! We've found our new Making Drama!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:39.500
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.990
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:45.950
Starting the Coord Change.

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:52.590
This uniform coord and its jagged cuts give a sharp and bold impression.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:55.140
Violet Crosswalk Coord!

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:56.300
<i>Go</i>!

00:17:57.740 --> 00:18:02.750
And in blue, the pedestrian crossing-
like stripes come alive with a poppy feel!

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:05.630
Sky-Blue Crosswalk Coord!

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:06.780
Yay!

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:13.470
The hat, featuring the members' initials, completes the latest team coord!

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:15.960
Scarlet Crosswalk Coord!

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.200
Go for it-usa!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:25.280
We finally get to hear Dressing Pafé's new song-pri!

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:28.850
Thanks for waiting, everyone!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:30.380
We have a new song for you!

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:32.300
Our show's all new!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.160
Don't look away now!

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:50.620
Making Drama, switch on!

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.270
<i>Go</i>!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.110
Blue skies!

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:56.110
Yay!

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.630
The setting sun!

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.890
Looking at the twinkling stars,

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:01.380
the three of us together!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:04.500
Friends forever!

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:07.620
Youth, jumping, snapping!

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:14.060
Cyalume Change!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:20.700
<i>Go</i>!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:21.420
Yay!

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:56.300
Shion, you're so cool!

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:00.590
Dorothy too!

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:02.100
A vivid impression!

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:03.790
We're Dressing Pafé!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.260
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:12.720
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:14.970
Let's <i>go</i>!

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:19.760
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:23.120
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:44.230
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:46.610
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:56.810
We got Super Cyalume Coords!

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:58.040
<i>What</i>?

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:00.250
But why?

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:03.140
All right! We finally got the-usa!

00:22:03.140 --> 00:22:06.220
It wasn't all three, but we'll gloss over that for now-usa!

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:08.720
Don't cry, Dorothy!

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:11.370
Oh dear...

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:12.310
Fuzzy ear...

00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:13.900
But...

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:15.090
But why?

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:20.640
Why was I the only one not to get any?

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:53.020
Wow, so this is a Super Cyalume Coord!

00:23:53.020 --> 00:23:56.330
I'm just <i>so</i> happy for the two of you I could cry.

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:59.180
Don't worry about it! You'll get one soon – I know it!

00:23:59.180 --> 00:24:01.540
Hmph. It's not like I care about your dumb coords.

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:05.080
Say, maybe if you spend some more time with Jululu...

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:08.220
I'd rather throw up. I mean, who does that little brat think she is, anyway?

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:11.880
I took such great care of her and she doesn't have an ounce of gratitude or praise;

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:13.180
and she cries and pees herself...

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:15.640
N–Next time, Tension 100 Max!

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:16.610
Yeah, stick it in your ear.

00:24:16.610 --> 00:24:19.810
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's <i>go</i>, PriPara!
